{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2021-04-06 07:15:00', 'title': 'CORTEVA NAMES DAVE ANDERSON EVP & CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL., APRIL 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CORTEVA, INC. (NYSE: CTVA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS APPOINTED DAVE ANDERSON AS ITS NEW EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT & CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER (CFO), EFFECTIVE APRIL 12, 2021.'}